OL,3,GNEWSAPetty thieves and organised gangs
OL,4,A- on patrol with the retail crime team
OL,5,
OL,6,FWithin the first half an hour of being
OL,7,Fout on patrol with police in
OL,8,FScarborough on a Friday afternoon, I
OL,9,Fwatch as officers detain a wanted
OL,10,Fperson in Superdrug.
OL,12,FThey quickly stop the suspect as they
OL,13,Ftry to leave the store before arresting
OL,14,Fthem.
OL,16,FWithin a couple of hours, a man linked
OL,17,Fto shoplifting offences has also been
OL,18,Farrested.
